    "description": "ZTE uses a multi-layered naming strategy across its portfolio. The Axon series represents the flagship line with numbers indicating generation and 'Ultra' for the top-tier model. The Blade series is ZTE's volume driver with sub-letter series (A, V, L) indicating different market segments. nubia serves as a premium sub-brand with 'Z' series for flagships, 'Redmagic' for gaming, and 'Neo' for accessible gaming. Model suffixes like 'Pro', 'Plus', 'Max', 'Ultra', 'SE', and 'GT' denote variants within each series."
